  - `cycle42-run10.md:41` (F6), which records an older checkpoint → reopen → continue pattern (`build_gpu_kernel.py:140-148` plus `finish_gpu_kernel.py:24-27`) with two guards. That was a different mechanism (a GPU-kernel build, no plan-step binding), so it does not cover this card.

